# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Atlas Gym — environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your database URL.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Postgres connection string. Works with Vercel Postgres, Neon,
# Supabase, Railway, or a local Postgres instance.
#
# Neon (free):     https://neon.tech  → copy the connection string
# Vercel Postgres: Storage tab → .env.local tab → POSTGRES_URL
#
# Use a DIRECT (non-pooled) connection so `prisma db push` can run
# schema migrations. Example:
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname?sslmode=require"
